From 67fed384844057a359f65f45fa35fe066bdde932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcsm <mcsm@localhost>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:37:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] flutter_gpu: cheaper draws and passes (mcsm7): pipelines
 cached on each RenderPipeline across passes (plain-word keys) and a
 recent-pipeline cache for cull/winding/primitive changes; state versions
 moved only by real changes; bindings in bind-order arrays; a sampler cache;
 replays skip repeated binds; direct writes to host-visible textures
 (Texture_McsmWriteDirect); several passes in turn on one command buffer;
 McsmFeatures bits 16, 64, 128

